μvi=(is)1−lL+0.3⁢lL−1subscript𝜇subscript𝑣𝑖superscript𝑖𝑠1𝑙𝐿0.3𝑙𝐿1\mu_{v_{i}}=(\frac{i}{s})^{1-\frac{l}{L}}+\frac{0.3l}{L-1} and μri=12⋅(is)1−lLsubscript𝜇subscript𝑟𝑖⋅12superscript𝑖𝑠1𝑙𝐿\mu_{r_{i}}=\frac{1}{2}\cdot(\frac{i}{s})^{1-\frac{l}{L}}

